    {
      "file": "sokoban-quest.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 204,
      "zh": "直线入库",
      "en": "Straight Shot"
    },
    {
      "file": "sokoban-quest.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 204,
      "zh": "先确认箱体与库位的相对方向，一次推动完成入库。",
      "en": "Check the box's direction relative to its goal, then store it with a single push."
    },
    {
      "file": "sokoban-quest.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 205,
      "zh": "转角换位",
      "en": "Corner Swap"
    },
    {
      "file": "sokoban-quest.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 205,
      "zh": "不能拉动货箱；先绕到货箱下方，再沿竖线推进。",
      "en": "Boxes cannot be pulled; walk around below the box first, then push it up the vertical line."
    },
    {
      "file": "sokoban-quest.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 206,
      "zh": "双货分流",
      "en": "Two-Box Split"
    },
    {
      "file": "sokoban-quest.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 206,
      "zh": "两只货箱共享作业区，错误的先后顺序会封住横向通道。",
      "en": "Two boxes share the work area; the wrong order will block the horizontal aisle."
    },
    {
      "file": "sokoban-quest.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 207,
      "zh": "第二章 · 柱网货场",
      "en": "Chapter 2 · Pillar Yard"
    },
    {
      "file": "sokoban-quest.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 207,
      "zh": "中柱绕行",
      "en": "Around the Pillar"
    },
    {
      "file": "sokoban-quest.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 207,
      "zh": "承重柱切断直线路径，规划工人的绕行空间后再推箱。",
      "en": "A load-bearing pillar blocks the straight path; plan the worker's way around it before pushing."
    },
    {
      "file": "sokoban-quest.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 208,
      "zh": "双区接驳",
      "en": "Twin Zones"
    },
    {
      "file": "sokoban-quest.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 208,
      "zh": "隔墙把上层分成两个库区，底部通廊是唯一换边路线。",
      "en": "A divider splits the upper level into two storage zones; the bottom corridor is the only way across."
    },
    {
      "file": "sokoban-quest.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 209,
      "zh": "三列并仓",
      "en": "Three Columns"
    },
    {
      "file": "sokoban-quest.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 209,
      "zh": "三只货箱必须重新排队，先释放左侧站位才能横向调度。",
      "en": "Three boxes must be re-queued; free the left-hand spot first to move sideways."
    },
    {
      "file": "sokoban-quest.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 210,
      "zh": "第三章 · 狭道夜班",
      "en": "Chapter 3 · Narrow Night Shift"
    },
    {
      "file": "sokoban-quest.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 210,
      "zh": "侧仓回转",
      "en": "Side Bay Turn"
    },
    {
      "file": "sokoban-quest.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 210,
      "zh": "凹槽边缘没有多余站位，把最深处库位留到最后处理。",
      "en": "The alcove edge has no spare standing room; leave the deepest goal for last."
    },
    {
      "file": "sokoban-quest.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 211,
      "zh": "十字换轨",
      "en": "Cross Switch"
    },
    {
      "file": "sokoban-quest.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 211,
      "zh": "中央横道同时承担通行和换向，货箱进入前要留出回身空间。",
      "en": "The central cross aisle serves for both passing and turning; leave turning room before a box enters."
    },
    {
      "file": "sokoban-quest.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 212,
      "zh": "顺序锁仓",
      "en": "Ordered Lock"
    },
    {
      "file": "sokoban-quest.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 212,
      "zh": "三座库位排列紧密，从外向内推进会锁死入口。",
      "en": "Three goals sit close together; pushing from the outside in will lock the entrance."
    },
    {
      "file": "sokoban-quest.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 213,
      "zh": "第四章 · 总库会战",
      "en": "Chapter 4 · Grand Depot"
    },
    {
      "file": "sokoban-quest.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 213,
      "zh": "窄桥调头",
      "en": "Narrow Bridge Turn"
    },
    {
      "file": "sokoban-quest.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 213,
      "zh": "单格桥口不允许并排会车，先在宽区完成货箱排序。",
      "en": "A one-tile bridge mouth allows no passing side by side; sort the boxes in the wide area first."
    },
    {
      "file": "sokoban-quest.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 214,
      "zh": "三库联调",
      "en": "Three-Depot Mix"
    },
    {
      "file": "sokoban-quest.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 214,
      "zh": "三只货箱争用中央场地，边线库位与内线库位需要交替处理。",
      "en": "Three boxes compete for the central floor; side goals and inner goals must be handled in turn."
    },
    {
      "file": "sokoban-quest.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 215,
      "zh": "零点总调",
      "en": "Zero Hour"
    },
    {
      "file": "sokoban-quest.html",
      "kind": "js",
      "line": 215,
      "zh": "承重墙、狭道与四只货箱叠加；每次推动都应保留下一次站位。",
      "en": "Load-bearing walls, narrow lanes and four boxes combined; each push should keep a spot free for the next."
    },
